# Kaiserterrasse pile (decorative, NON-solid, like netz_post; M4): the
# right end leg of oneway_wood (`kOlk`, columns 11-14, plain wood, no joints)
# continued down to the ground under the Weisses Roessl terrace. Vertical
# autotile only: an open bottom gets a k-outlined i/m/d stone footing in
# rows 12-15; left/right bits are ignored. `_r` is written out by hand (not
# mirrored) so the O|l light stays lit-left.
# Autotiled (D-020): anim `auto`, frame = neighbour mask
# (1 = same tile above, 2 = right, 4 = below, 8 = left; level edge = same).
sprite = tile_terrasse_post_r
size   = 16x16
origin = 0,0
anim   = auto frames=16 ticks=1
